    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d825">

                <pb facs="0855" n="843" xml:id="pg843"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867N.01/12–2145: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Syria</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Porter</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Damascus</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-12-21T16:00:00+02:00">December 21,
                            1945—4 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> Received December 23—6:03 p.m.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>98. With official encouragement press has momentarily turned aside from its
                    preoccupation with Anglo-French accord on Levant<anchor n="66" xml:id="d825-f1"
                    /> to discuss with extreme bitterness Congressional resolution advocating Jewish
                    immigration into Palestine.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Porter</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
